OL,3,GNEWSANew Barrhead railway station
OL,4,Awelcomes first passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new railway station in East
OL,7,FRenfrewshire has opened its platforms
OL,8,Fto passengers.
OL,10,FThe #18.3m Balgray station in Barrhead
OL,11,Fconnects people in the town with
OL,12,FGlasgow city centre, with the first
OL,13,Ftrain arriving about 08:50.
OL,15,FServices will run every 30 minutes
OL,16,Fbetween Balgray and Glasgow Central,
OL,17,Fstopping at the likes of Whitecraigs,
OL,18,FMount Florida and Cathcart.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
